#X restore 430 135 graph;
#X obj 30 432 daw_storage curve-editor-help;
#X text 20 8 curve-editor: draw a curve. The patch receives numbers.;
#X text 430 26 Plain [curve-editor] opens 0..1 / 257.;
#X text 430 44 This help uses [curve-editor fullrange]:;
#X text 430 62 -1..+1 on both axes. 513 samples out.;
#X text 430 300 Drag a dot to move it.;
#X text 430 322 Drag between dots to bend the curve.;
#X text 430 344 Double-click empty space adds a dot.;
#X text 430 366 Double-click a dot removes it.;
#X text 430 388 End dots slide up and down only.;
#X text 430 410 No removing them. Shape in run mode: Cmd+E.;
#X text 430 432 Ctrl+E on Windows and Linux.;
#X text 200 404 left outlet fills the array;
#X text 30 456 saved state loops back to the inlet;
#X text 430 460 Fullrange starts symmetric with a dim mirror.;
#X text 430 482 bipolar 0 mirrors. bipolar 1 unlocks both.;
#X text 430 504 bipolar 0 rebuilds it. Negative edits go.;
#X text 430 526 Mirrored middle dot moves up and down only.;
#X text 430 548 size is fullrange-only. A lone N means square.;
#X text 430 570 base <list> layers a Base under Your Curve.;
#X text 430 592 Outlets: 1 is Results. 2 saves Your Curve.;
#X text 430 614 The straight line list resets the shape.;
#X text 430 640 bang re-sends the curve and the state.;
#X text 20 478 Snap + grid:;
#X msg 20 500 snap 1;
#X msg 20 526 snap 0;
#X msg 20 552 grid 1;
#X msg 20 578 grid 0;
#X obj 20 612 s \$0-help-in;
#X text 130 478 Density:;
#X msg 130 500 gridsub 16;
#X msg 130 526 gridup;
#X msg 130 552 griddown;
#X obj 130 612 s \$0-help-in;
#X text 250 478 Mode:;
#X msg 250 500 bipolar 1;
#X msg 250 526 bipolar 0;
#X msg 250 552 fullrange 1;
#X msg 250 578 fullrange 0;
#X obj 250 612 s \$0-help-in;
#X text 20 670 Base + reset:;
#X msg 20 692 base 0 0 0.5 0.3 0.2 0.5 0.5 0.5 0.5 0.7 0.8 0.5 1 1;
#X msg 385 692 base clear;
#X msg 490 692 0 0 0.5 1 1;
#X obj 580 692 s \$0-help-in;
#X text 20 720 Size:;
#X msg 20 742 size 420 360;
#X msg 135 742 size 300 300;
#X obj 255 742 s \$0-help-in;
#X text 20 772 Demo buttons use [s $0-help-in] + [r $0-help-in].;
#X text 20 792 $0 keeps each open copy on its own channel.;
#X text 20 812 Left outlet: 257 legacy. 513 fullrange. Values 0 to 1.;
#X text 20 832 Fullrange: 0 is -1. 0.5 is 0. 1 is +1.;
#X text 20 852 Right outlet: raw state for [daw_storage].;
#X text 20 872 Legacy state is x y bend plus a flag.;
#X text 20 892 Fullrange state starts -271828 2 1.;
#X text 20 912 Mode bipolar size save with the shape.;
#X text 20 932 Plugin restores on reopen. Standalone does not.;
#X text 20 952 Snap grid density reset. snap 1 halves bending.;
#X text 20 972 No Shift snap here. Close dots grab by the outer edges.;
